// Mirrored versions
//      These mirrored versions aren't only for visual flare, but also a small "workaround"
//      for how animated particles/Texture definitions work.
//    since they all share the same space in memory, if two particles with the same texture animation
//    spawn right after the other, the animation for one of them will be reset and play again from the beginning.
//      It is important to have this extra redundancy so that noticeable goofs like this are VERY rare.
